# Netlify CLI local state (site link, cached plugins, machine-local absolute
# paths) - regenerates per machine via `netlify link`/`netlify build`. Was
# previously committed and caused a real bug: this file's build.base/publish
# paths kept getting silently rewritten to the last machine's absolute path,
# breaking every cloud build until noticed (see commit 8599cf2).
.netlify/
